# Backend .gitignore — ASP.NET Core / Visual Studio

## Build outputs
/bin/
/obj/
**/bin/
**/obj/

## Visual Studio / Rider
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.rsuser
*.DotSettings.user

## Logs
*.log
logs/
artifacts/

## NuGet
packages/
*.nupkg

## Publish output
publish/

## Local config / secrets (do not commit production secrets)
appsettings.Development.json
secrets.json
.env
.env.*

## Database files
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.db

## Do NOT ignore EF Migrations — those should be versioned in source control
